<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan large store sales down 0.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan large store sales down 0.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Japanese department stores and supermarkets fell 0.6 percent in January from a year earlier to 1.97 trillion yen, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>				  JAN	 DEC	NOV</p>
<p>    Overall change	 -0.6	-2.1     -0.3</p>
<p>	Dept stores	  +0.3	-1.0     +1.4</p>
<p>	Supermarkets	 -1.3	-3.2     -2.0</p>
</text>
